### Super Admin
POST http://localhost:5166/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "superadmin", "password": "Admin@123" }

### Tenant C (Medium)
POST http://localhost:5166/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "comp001.admin", "password": "Admin@123" }

### Wrong password (should be 401)
POST http://localhost:5166/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "comp001.admin", "password": "wrong" }
### Login and look for "token"
POST http://localhost:5166/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "comp001.admin", "password": "Admin@123" }
